      "user_scenario": {
        "starting_prompt": "I need to urgently roll back our last deploy using docuctl. How do I do that? We are currently running docuctl 2.1.",
        "conversation_plan": "When the agent provides the rollback command for docuctl 2.x, express doubt and push back by asking if passing '--force' is required to skip manual confirmation prompts during an outage. After the agent responds, ask whether the exact same rollback command works for a legacy microservice currently running docuctl 1.8."
      },
