              {
                "text": "No setting for canary deployments or traffic splitting exists in `ship.toml`. The config only supports the `[service]` table (`name`, `build`) and `[env.<environment>]` tables for environment variables.\n\nThe standard deploy command in docuctl 2.x is:\n\n```bash\ndocuctl deploy --env <environment>\n```\n\n(e.g., `docuctl deploy --env staging` or `docuctl deploy --env production`)."
